{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026iqYemc0GUX1793023490.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>一名87歲老翁被控刑事毀壞，跑馬地天主教聖彌額爾墳場土地。他否認控罪，指只是協助修葺墓碑。</p><p></p><p>案件在東區裁判法院處理，87歲被告曹元緒被控7月24日，破壞天主教聖彌額爾墳場土地。辯方指被告不打算認罪，堅信自己無毀壞，不願意以其他方式處理案件。</p><p></p><p>辯方又提及墳墓涉及一名修女生前曾照顧被告。由於他認為修女的墳墓「太爛」，感覺過於「淒涼」，所以經常到場修葺。</p><p></p><p>總裁判官蘇惠德，將案押後至12月底再訊，被告或聘大律師處理案件。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T16:01:12.155623+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":208,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T12:36:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T05:18:20.838449+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T15:58:13.654973+00:00","content_hash":"ed1c06598a84076f46ff02e15ed4e7e3071c8ce83566da77cd3890415c441c32","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T16:01:12.155623+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}